  "description": "A lightweight, ultra-fast, and memory-optimized .NET Standard 2.0 library to read, write, and stream spreadsheet files (XLSX, XLS, CSV, TSV, HTML, XML 2003, JSON). Features native XLS binary reading (BIFF8/OLE2), a zero-allocation streaming reader/writer, automatic file format signature detection, and an independent Excel formula calculation engine with cycle reference verification.",
